## Phase 1 - Adopt DwarfUI tooltip dependency boundary

☑ Add DwarfUI tooltip registration dependency where SoulSearch currently owns
tooltip rendering lifecycle.
☑ Ensure SoulSearch relies on DwarfUI widget extension contracts (tooltip and
pointer attributes) rather than custom local tooltip stack ownership.
☑ Confirm DwarfUI runtime contract availability for local development:
  - [../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/tooltip/api.lua](../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/tooltip/api.lua)
  - [../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/tooltip/registration.lua](../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/tooltip/registration.lua)
  - [../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/widget_extensions.lua](../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/widget_extensions.lua)

Exit gate: SoulSearch code paths can reference DwarfUI tooltip APIs without
requiring legacy renderer ownership.

### Phase 1 execution evidence (2026-07-31)

- Implemented dependency boundary probes in current tooltip-owner roots:
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/main_screen.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/main_screen.lua)
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/soulsearch-stats-overlay.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/soulsearch-stats-overlay.lua)
- Implemented DwarfUI-compatible pointer policy contract adoption in SoulSearch
widget extensions:
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/widget_extensions.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/widget_extensions.lua)
- Implemented dual-compatibility pointer resolution so SoulSearch accepts both
legacy string policies and DwarfUI enum policy members:
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/pointer_dispatcher.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/pointer_dispatcher.lua)
- DwarfUI local runtime contract availability confirmed from sibling project:
  - [../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/tooltip/api.lua](../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/tooltip/api.lua)
  - [../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/tooltip/registration.lua](../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/tooltip/registration.lua)
  - [../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/widget_extensions.lua](../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/widget_extensions.lua)
- Validation note:
  - Unit-test runner still reports the known baseline failures from
    [../tests/search_spec.lua](../tests/search_spec.lua) and
    [../tests/component_support_spec.lua](../tests/component_support_spec.lua);
    no new Phase 1-specific regression signature was introduced.
  - DwarfUI tooltip module reorganization was incorporated by preferring
    `dwarfui/tooltip/api` and `dwarfui/tooltip/registration` only.

## Phase 2 - Migrate root ownership from local renderer to registration

☑ Remove SoulSearch root-level `self.tooltip` and `self.tooltip_agent`
construction from:
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/main_screen.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/main_screen.lua)
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/soulsearch-stats-overlay.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/soulsearch-stats-overlay.lua)
☑ Remove per-frame tooltip update calls currently executed during render.
☑ Register tooltip-bearing controls with DwarfUI under the appropriate root.
☑ Verify main screen and overlay both resolve to the correct presentation
surface under DwarfUI transport selection.

Exit gate: SoulSearch no longer instantiates `SoulSearchTooltip` or
`TooltipAgent` in active UI roots.

### Phase 2 execution evidence (2026-07-31)

- Main screen migration completed:
  - removed `ui_tooltip` and `tooltip_agent` root ownership;
  - removed render-loop tooltip update;
  - added DwarfUI registration/unregistration over the window subtree.
  - file: [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/main_screen.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/main_screen.lua)
- Stats overlay migration completed:
  - removed `ui_tooltip` and `tooltip_agent` root ownership;
  - removed overlay-local tooltip repaint path;
  - added DwarfUI registration/unregistration over overlay subtree;
  - wired registration to `init`, `overlay_onenable`, `overlay_ondisable`, and
    `onDestroy` lifecycle points.
  - file: [../src/scripts_modinstalled/soulsearch-stats-overlay.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/soulsearch-stats-overlay.lua)
- Verification snapshot:
  - no remaining root references to `ui_tooltip`, `tooltip_agent`,
    `self.tooltip`, `self.tooltip_agent`, or `tooltip_agent:update()` in the
    two migrated roots;
  - both roots now use `dwarfui/tooltip/api` registration calls.

